<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="DAN" style="id">Daniela</book>
  <para style="h">Daniela</para>
  <para style="toc1">Daniela</para>
  <para style="toc2">Daniela</para>
  <para style="mt">Daniela</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judai rama Jehoiakima a lal kum thumnaah Babulon lal Nebukadnezara chu Jerusalemah a lo kal a, a hual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa thuin Juda lal Jehoiakima chu a man a, Pathian ina bungbêl ṭhenkhat pawh a la a, an pathian in awmna Sinar ramah a kalpui a; a bungbêl lâkte chu an pathian ina thil dahkhâwmnaah chuan a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lal chuan hotu lian Aspenaza, mi tilreh chu, Israel lal thlah leh milian fa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tlangvâl pian fel, hmêlṭha leh engkima mi vengva, thil zir thei mi, hriatna ngah, lal ina chetla tlâk thlang chhuaka, Kaldai ṭawng leh lehkha zirtîr tûrin thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lal chuan, lal chawhmeh tui leh a in ṭhin ang uain, ni tin a pêktîr bawk a. Kum thum an zir hnuah lal hnênah an inlan tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chûng mi thlante chu Juda thlah zînga mi Daniela te, Hanania te, Misaela te, Azaria te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hotu lian, mi tilreh chuan an hming a sa thar a, Daniela chu Beltesazara a vuah a, Hanania chu Sadraka, Misaela chu Mesaka, Azaria chu Abednegoa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Daniela chuan chawhmeh tui leh uain lalin a in ṭhin chuan intihbawlhhlawh loh a tum tlat a, hotu lian, mi tilreh chu a intihbawlhhlawh loh nân ṭanpuiah a sâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hotu lian, mi tilreh chu, Lalpan Daniela duhsakin a khawngaihtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Daniela hnênah, “Lal thuin ei leh in tûr kan pe che u a, ka pu lalber chuan in rualpui tlangvâl dangte aia in sa a chhiat hlauh chuan min that mai ang tih ka hlau a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hotu lian, mi tilreh chuan Daniela te, Hanania te, Misaela te, Azaria te enkawltu tûr a ruat a; chu mi hnênah chuan Danielan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Ni sâwm chhûng chu thlai hnephnawl leh tuisik chauh min pe la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />lal chawhmeh eiho tlangvâlte nên kan hmêl en chhin la, ṭha i tih angin i chhiahhlawhte chungah thil i ti dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chu thil chungchânga an thu sawi chu a ngaithla a, ni sâwm chhûng chu a en chhin ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ni sâwm a ral hnu chuan lal chawhmeh eiho tlangvâlte ai chuan an hmêl a mawi a, an sa pawh a ṭha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tichuan, anmahni enkawltupa chuan chawhmeh tui leh uain an in tûr chu pe lovin thlai hnephnawl chauh a pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hêng tlangvâl palite hi Pathianin thil zir theihna a pe a, lehkha an thiam theiin an fing sâwt êm êm a; Daniela phei chu inlârnate leh mumangte hrilh fiah theihna a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lal hun tiam kum thum chu a ral a, hotu lian, mi tilreh chuan Nebukadnezara hnênah anni chu a hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lal chuan an za-in a lo be vêl a, Daniela te, Hanania te, Misaela te, Azaria te tluk tu mah an awm lo; chuvângin, lal upate zîngah an tel ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thufing leh thil hriat âwm rêng rêng lalin a zawh apiang a ram chhûnga arsi chhui mi te, aienthiam te, aikaih thiam te hriat lêt sâwm an hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Daniela chu lal Kuran Babulon a rawn rûn thleng khân lal bulah a khawsa a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A lal kum hnih kumin Nebukadnezara chuan mumang a nei a, a rilru a tibuai hle a, mut pawh a mu thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A mumang chu sawi tûrin lal chuan arsi chhui mi te, bo hre thei te, aienthiam te leh Kaldai mi thiam te a ko va. An lo kal a, lal hmaah chuan an ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lal chuan an hnênah, “Mumang ka nei a, min timangang hle a ni; engtihna nge tih hriat ka duh a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kaldai-ho chuan Aramaik ṭawngin an chhâng a, “Lal chu dam reng rawh se, i mumang chu i chhiahhlawhte hi han hrilh la, kan hrilh fiah mai ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lal chuan, “Ka mumang hi a awmzia min hrilh ngei tûr a ni. Min hrilh theih loh chuan in kut leh ke ka pawhthlâksak ang che u a, in inte ka tiram vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka mumang leh a awmzia min hrilh theih erawh chuan lâwmman tam tak ka pe ang che u a, ka chawimawi bawk ang che u. Ka mumang leh a awmzia mi han hrilh teh u le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Lalpa chuan a mumang chu a chhiahhlawhte hi hrilh mai sela, keinin kan hrilh fiah ang,” tiin an chhâng leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutah lal chu a ṭêk ta a, “Ka thu ka hlen dâwn tih in hriat avângin tihkhawtlai dân in zawng tih ka hre chiang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />In hrilh fiah theih loh chuan thuhmun ṭheuhvin ka hrem ngei dâwn che u a ni. Nakin deuhvah thil a danglam mai ang tih beiseiin dâwt min hrilha, thil tihkhawtlai in tum a nih hi. Ka mumang chu min han hrilh mai ula; tichuan, in hrilh fiah theih leh theih loh pawh ka hre mai ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kaldai mi thiamte chuan lal chu an chhâng a, “Khawvêlah hian i hriat duh chu tu mah sawi thei an awm lo vang. Lal ropui ber te leh thiltithei ber te, tu mahin an arsi chhui mi te, bo hre thei te leh aien thiam te hnênah hetiang thil hi an zâwt ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalin i hriat duh hi a khirh êm a, pathiante chauh lo chuan tu man an hre lo vang, pathiante lah kan zîngah an awm si lo,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan lal chu a thinur ta êm êm a, Babulon mi thiam rualte chu tihhlum tûrin thu a pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi thiamte thah thu pêk a nih tâk avângin Daniela leh a ṭhiante pawh chu thah tûr an ni ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi thiam rual that tûra tirh, lal vêngtute hotupa Arioka chu Daniela chuan fîmkhur tak leh hawihhâwm takin a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Engtizia nge heti taka khauhva lalin thu a pêk le?” a ti a. Arioka chuan thil awm dân chu Daniela a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Daniela chu lal hnênah a kal a, mumang chu a hrilh fiah theih nân hun a dîl belh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, Daniela chu a hâwng a, a ṭhian Hanania te, Misaela te, Azaria te chu thil awm dân a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Babulon mi thiam dangte ruala thah an nih loh nân vân Pathian khawngaihna ngêna, chu thu khirh chu hrilh fiah theihna dîl tûrin a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chumi zân la la chuan a mumangah chu thu khirh chu a hnêna hrilh fiah a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Daniela chuan vân Pathian chu lâwmthu a hrilh a: “Pathian chu a fing a, thil a ti thei a, Amah chu fak kumkhua tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hun te, khua te, a thuin an awm a, Lal te a bân a, a siam bawk a, Finna leh hriatna petu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thu khirh leh thûk tak takte chu a puang a, Thim zînga thil thuhrûkte pawh a hmu a, Êngin a vêl a hual a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Min thlahtute Pathian, Ka fakin ka chawimawi a che, Finna leh chakna min pe a, Ka ṭawngṭai i lo ngaithla a, Lal hnêna sawi tûr min hrilh tâk hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lalin mi thiam rual that tûra a tirh Arioka hnênah Daniela chu a kal a, a hnênah, “Mi thiam rual hi that mai teh suh, lal hnênah min hruai la, a mumang chu ka hrilh fiahsak ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Arioka chuan Daniela chu lal hnênah chuan a hruai ta nghâl a, lal hnênah chuan, “Judai ram aṭanga sal zîngah lal mumang hrilh fiah thei tûr mi ka hmu ta,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lal chuan Daniela hnênah (a hming dang chu Beltesazara a ni), “Ka mumang leh a awmzia mi hrilh thei ang maw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Daniela chuan lal hnênah, “Bo hre thei emaw, aien thiam emaw, arsi chhui mi emaw, mi fing, chu thu khirh hrilh fiah thei tûr tu mah an awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, vânah Pathian a awm a, ani chuan mite hnênah thu rilte a puang ṭhîn; lal Nebukadnezara hnênah pawh nakin lawka thil lo thleng tûr a rawn puang a nih hi. I mumanga i thil hmuh chu ka han hrilh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Khuma i mut laiin lal chuan thil lo thleng tûrte i ngaihtuah a. Thu ril tifiah tûrin Pathian chuan thil lo thleng tûr chu a entîr che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka fin bîk vâng ni lovin lal hian i mumang awmzia i hriata, i rilrua thu lo lût chu i hriatthiam theih nân he thu ril awmzia hi ka hnênah tihlan a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ani, ka pu, i mangah chuan milim lian pui mai, tle vur hi i lo hmu a, en ngam loh khawpa hlauhawm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A lu chu rangkachak ṭha ber chia siam a ni, a âwm leh a bân chu tangkarua, a dul leh a kâwngbâwr chu dâr;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />a ke chu thîr, a ke bâwr chu thîr leh hlum inchawhpawlha siam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />I en reng a, chutih lai chuan khâm aṭangin tu ma tihbal ni lo lung lian tak a lo lum a, thîr leh hluma siam milim kephah chu a rawn delh a, a sawm ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Thîr te, hlum te, dâr te, tangkarua te leh rangkachak te pawh chu a keh sawm a, nipui laia hruiha buhsi ang mai an lo ni ta a; thliin a lên bo va, a hnuhma pakhat mah hmuh tûr a awm ta lo va. Lung erawh kha chu a lian tual tual a, tlâng tiat ngawt a ni a, leiah a khat ta mup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Chutiang chu a ni lal mumang chu, ka han hrilh fiah ang e:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Lal azawngah lal ropui ber i ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Vân Pathian chuan ram te, thiltihtheihna te, chakna te leh ropuina te a pe che a. Leia mihring chêngte chungah rorêltuah a siam che a, sava leh rannung chungah pawh thu a neihtîr che hi. Rangkachaka siam lu ang chu i ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />I hnuah i ram aia nêp lalram dang a lo ding ang a, dâr ang lek lalram dang pawh a lo la ding leh zêl ang, chu chuan khawvêl ro a rêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Nangmah anga chak lal dang, a palina tûr, thil tichhiaa tidarh thei, thîr ang an lo lal leh ang. Thîrin thil dang a tichhia ang hian lei lalram lo awm hmasate chu a rawn tichhiain a rawn tidarh vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Milim ke leh kezungpui chu, thîr leh hlum inchawhpawlh a nih i hmu a; chu chuan, chu ram chu lungrual lo a nih tûr a entîr a; thîr leh hlum a ni a, thîr anga chakna lai a nei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A kezungpui chu thîr leh hlum inchawhpawlh bawk a ni a, ram chu a ṭhen lai a chak ang a, a ṭhen lai erawh chu a chak lo hle ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Thîr leh hlum inchawhpawlh i hmu a, chutiangin chu ram rorêltute chuan chhûngkaw inzawm khâwm tumin an inneih pawlh ang a, mahse thîr leh hlum a inchawhpawlh thei lo ang bawk hian an inzawm khâwm tak tak thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Chûng rorêltute hun lai chuan Vân Pathian chuan, ram hlun tûr, ramthar, a rawn din ang a, chu chu tu man an hneh thei lo vang; lal ram dangte chu a tichhe vek ang a, ani erawh chu a awm reng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tu ma tihbal ni lo, khâm aṭanga lung lo tla kha i hmu bawk a; hlum te, thîr te, dâr te, tangkarua te leh rangkachak tea siam milim chu a delh tâk kha i hmu bawk a. Pathian ropui tak chuan lal hnênah thil lo thleng tûr a hrilh che a ni. I mumang chu ka hrilh ta che a, a awmzia pawh ka hrilh tâk che hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Lal Nebukadnezara chu a bawkkhup a, Daniela chu chibai a bûk a, rimtui leh thilpêk Daniela hnêna hlan tûr thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Lal chuan Daniela hnênah, “He thu ril hi i sawi fiah theih avângin i Pathian chu Pathian ropui ber a lo nih hi; lalte Lal a ni a, thu ril puangtu i nih ka hre ta,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Daniela chu a siam lian a, thilpêk ṭha tak tak a pe a, Babulon bial a enkawltîr a, Babulon mi thiam rual hotu-ah a siam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Daniela dîl angin Sadraka te, Mesaka te, Abednegoa te chu Babulon ram ṭhen hmun dangah hotu-ah a dah a, Daniela erawh chu lal bulah a awm ve ta zêl a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lal Nebukadnezaran rangkachak milim a siam a, a sân lam chu tawng sawmruk a ni a, a vâng lam chu tawng ruk a ni. Babulon biala Dura phaizâwlah milim chu a din a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A hnuaia lal tenau te, ramawptute leh biala sawrkâr hna thawk zawng zawng chu lal Nebukadnezara din milim serh ni chhim tûrin a chah khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Milim serh hran ni chuan chûng lal tênau te, ramawptu te, thuneitu te, bial hotu te, tangka vawngtu te, rorêltu te, thuremtu te leh sawrkâr hna thawk zawng zawng te chu an lo kal khâwm a, milim hmaah chuan an ding ṭhup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tlângauvin ring takin heti hian thu a rawn puang a, “Hnam tin, chi tin, ṭawng tin hmangte u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tawtawrâwt an hâm ri in hria ang a, ṭingṭang te, perhkhuang te, bengbung te, phênglâwng te, rawchhêm te leh thil tum rîk theih chi dang te an rawn tum ang a; chûng thil chu an rawn tum veleh lal Nebukadnezara rangkachak milim hmaah in bawkkhup ang a, chibai in bûk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tu pawh, bawkkhupa chibai bûk duh lo chu meipuia paih tûr an ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, thil tum ri an hriat veleh hnam tin, chi tin leh ṭawng tin hmangte chu lal Nebukadnezara rangkachak milim hmaah chuan an kûn a, chibai an bûk ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Babulon mi ṭhenkhatten chu chu Juda-te hêkna remchângah an hmang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />lal Nebukadnezara hnênah, “Aw lalber, dam reng ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />‘Tawtawrâwt te, ṭingṭang te, perhkhuang te, phênglâwng te, rawchhem te leh thil tum rîk theih chi dangte an tum rîk in hriat veleh rangkachak milim hmaah in bawkkhup ang a, chibai in bûk tûr a ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />a bûk duh lo tawh phawt chu meipuia paih tûr,’ tiin thu i pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Juda mi, Babulon bial ṭhenkhat hotua i dah Sadraka te, Mesaka te, Abednegoa te hian i thu rêng an ngai lo va, i pathiante chibai an bûk duh lo, i rangkachak milim hmaah pawh an kûn duh ve hauh lo,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lal Nebukadnezara chu a thinur ta êm êm a, Sadraka te, Mesaka te, Abednegoa te chu a hmaa rawn hruai tûrin thu a pe a, anni chu lal hmaah chuan an rawn hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nebukadnezara chuan, “Sadrak, Mesak, Abednego, ka pathian chibai in bûk duh lo va, ka milim din hmaah in kûn duh hek lo tih hi a dik em?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tawtawrâwt te, ṭingṭang te, perhkhuang te, bengbung te, phênglâwng te, rawchhem te leh thil tum rîk theih chi dang an tum ri in hriatin ka milim siam hmaa bawkkhupa chibai in bûk duh chuan a ṭha a ni mai a, in bûk duh loh erawh chuan meipuia paih nghâl in ni ang. Pathian tuin nge ka kut ata chhan chhuak thei ang che u?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sadraka te, Mesaka te, Abednegoa te chuan lal chu an chhâng a, “Aw lal Nebukadnezar, he thilah hian kan chhân che a ṭûl lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ṭûl a nih chuan kan Pathian biak hian meipui ata min chhan chhuak thei asin, i kut ata pawh min chhan chhuak thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Min chhan loh pawhin, aw lalber, i pathiante chu chibai kan bûk chuang lo vang, rangkachak milim i din hmaah pawh kan kûn hek lo vang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lal Nebukadnezara chu a thinur ta êm êm a, Sadraka te, Mesaka te, Abednegoa te avâng chuan a hmai a sen ṭeuh mai a. Meipui chu a ngai aia lêt sariha saa tuah tûrin thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A sipai zînga chak chak chu Sadraka te, Mesaka te, Abednegoa te phuara meipuia paih lût tûrin thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An kawr te, diar te leh an silhfên dangte inbel vek chung chuan an phuar hlâwm a, meipuiah chuan an paih lût ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lal thupêk chu a khauh êm avâng leh meipui chu a sat êm avângin, Sadraka te, Mesaka te, Abednegoa te meipuia paihtute chu meialh chuan a hliau hlum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Anni pathum Sadraka, Mesaka, Abednegoa te chu phuar hlâwm reng chungin meipuiah chuan an tla lût ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lal Nebukadnezara chu mak ti zetin a tho thut a, thurâwntute hnênah chuan, “Phuar chungin mi pathum meipuiah kan paih lût a ni lâwm ni?” a ti a. Anni chuan, “Paih lût e, aw lalpa,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Mi pali phuar loh, meialh zînga vei vei ka va hmu si ve, na rêng an ti lo va, a palina phei chu Vântirhkoh hmêl pu a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lal Nebukadnezara chu meipui kawngkhâr bulah chuan a kal a, “Sadrak, Mesak, Abednego, lo chhuak ula hetah hian lo kal teh u,” a ti a. Sadraka te, Mesaka te, Abednegoa te chu meipui aṭang chuan an lo chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lal tênau te, ramawptu te, ram rorêltu te leh lal thurâwntu te chu an lo kal khâwm a, hêng mite taksa hi chu meiin a khawih lo va, an sam a kâng lo va, an silhfênte pawh a ût lo va, mei rim lah an nam hek lo tih an rawn hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nebukadnezara chuan, “Sadraka te, Mesaka te, Abednegoa te Pathian chu fakin awm rawh se. Ani chuan vântirhkoh a rawn tîr a, amah ringa a rawngbâwltute chu a rawn chhan chhuak ta a; lal thupêk awih duh lovin an taksa boral huamin an Pathian chauh lo chu Pathian dang an be duh lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chuvângin, hetiang hian thu ka pe e: Sadraka te, Mesaka te, Abednegoa te Pathian sawichhetu hnam emaw, chi emaw, ṭawng chi hrang hmang emaw rêng rêng chu an kut leh an ke pawhsawmsak an ni ang a, an inte pawh tihram a ni bawk ang. Hetianga mi chhan chhuak thei Pathian dang tu mah an awm lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Lal chuan Sadraka te, Mesaka te, Abednegoa te chu Babulon ram bial hotu zîngah a kaisântîr ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hnam tin, chi tin, ṭawng tin hmang, khawvêla awmte hnênah lal Nebukadnezaran hetiang hian thu a thawn a: “Remna in hnênah awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian Chungnungberan chhinchhiahna leh thil mak mi entîr hi lo hre ve teh u:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A chhinchhiahnate chu a va ropui êm! A thil tih makte chu a va nasa êm! A ram chu chatuan ram a ni a, Kumkhuain ro a rêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Kei, Nebukadnezara hi, ka in ropui takah thlamuang takin ka awm a, engkimah ka hmuingîl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mumang hlauhawm tak ka nei a, mumanga ka thil hmuhte chuan ka rilru a timangang hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka mumang chu hrilh fiah tûrin Babulon mi thiamte ka hruai khâwmtîr a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />bo hre thei te, aien thiam te, Kaldai mi thiam te leh arsi chhui mi te chu an lo kal a, ka mumang chu ka hrilh a; mahse, an hrilh fiah thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A tâwpah Daniela, a hming dang chu Beltesazara, ka Pathian hming chawia sak chu a lo kal a, amahah chuan Pathian thianghlim thlarau a chêng a; tichuan, ka mang chu ka hrilh ve ta a. A hnênah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />‘Nang Beltesazar, mi thiam rual hotu, Pathian thianghlim thlarau chu i hnênah a chêng tih ka hria; chuvângin, thu rilte pawh i hre vek a, ka mang chu hei hi a ni, hrilh fiah rawh le:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />‘Khum laizâwla mua ka thil hmuh chu, khawvêl laili lai takah thing sâng deuh mai hi a lo awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thing chu a ṭhang lian zêl a, a zîk chuan vân a tawng ta a; lei ram hmun tin aṭangin a lang thei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A hnahte chu a mawi hle a, a rah tep tup a, tu tân pawh kham khawpa ei tham a rah a. Ramsate chuan a hlim an bêl a, chunglêng savate chu a zârah an chêng a, thil nung tinrêngin a rah chu an tlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />‘Mua ka thil hmuh chu ka ngaihtuah laiin vân aṭangin vântirhkoh, inring reng a lo chhuk a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />hetiang hian ring takin a au va; ‘Thing kha kit ula, a ṭangte hlawi rawh u, a hnahte vaw ṭîl ula, a rahte paih vek rawh u, a hlim ata ramsate chu tlân darh sela, a zâr ata savate pawh thlâwk bo rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A bul bâwr chu a awm ngaiin awm sela, thîr leh dâr khaidiatin thlung ula, hnimin bawh rawh se. Vân daiin tlâk huh sela, ramsate nên hnim zîngah awm za rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A mihring rilru chu ramsa rilruah chang sela, a chungah kum sarih ral bawk rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hei hi Vântirhkoh inring rengho thurêl a ni; mihring ramte hi Chungnungbera thuhnuaia awm a ni a, mi nêp ber pawh a duh chuan a pe thei tih tu pawhin an hre dâwn nia,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Kei lal Nebukadnezara hian chu chu ka manga ka thil hmuh chu a ni; Beltesazar, nangin han hrilh fiah teh, ka ram mi thiamten an hrilh fiah thiam lo va, nang erawh chuan Pathian thianghlim thlarau i hnênah a chêng a, i hrilh fiah thei ngei ang,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Daniela, Beltesazara an tih bawk chuan, a hlau êm êm a, eng emaw chen chu eng mah a sawi thei lo va. Lal chuan, “Beltesazar, mumang leh a awmzia avângin thlaphâng suh,” a ti a. Beltesazara chuan, “Ka pu, he mumang hi nangmah hawtu tân ni sela, a kawh pawh i hmêlma tân ni teh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />I thing hmuh, sâng zeta ṭhang, vân tawng ta, khawvêl hmun tin aṭanga hmuh theih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />a hnah mawi tak, rah tep tup, mi tin ei tham, a hlim ramsaten an belh, a zâra savate chênna thing chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />aw lalber, nangmah hi i ni. I ṭhang lian a, i chak êm êm a, i ropuina chuan vân a tawng a, i ram chuan kâwlkil a thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Vân aṭanga vântirhkoh inring reng, lo chhuk i hmu a, ‘Thing kha kit ula, tiboral rawh u, a bul bâwr erawh chu a awmna ngaiah awm sela, thîr leh dâr khaidiatin thlung ula, hnimin bawh rawh se; vân daiin tlâk huh sela, kum sarih a ral hma chu ramsate nên awm za rawh se,’ a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aw lalber, hei hi a hrilhfiahna chu a ni: ka pu tâna Chungnungbera thupêk chu hei hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mihring zîng ata hnawh chhuah i ni ang a, ramsate nên in awm za ang. Bâwngpa angin hnim i pet ang a, vân daiin a tlâk huh ang che. Kum sarih ral hunah, Chungnungbera chuan mihring ram chungah thu a nei a, a duh duh a pe mai ṭhîn tih i hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thing bul bâwr a awm ngaia a awm tûr a ni tih ang khân Chungnungberan thu a nei tih i hriat hunah i la lal leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Tichuan, aw lalber, ka thurâwn che hi pawm hrâm teh; i sual sim la, thil dik ti rawh. I bawhchhiatnate pawh sim la, tihduhdahte khawngaih la; tichuan, thlamuang taka i awm chhûng hi pawh sei a ni mahna,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chûng thil chu Nebukadnezara chungah a thleng ta thuai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kum khat a vei hnu chuan Babulon lal in chung zâwla a lên laiin heti hian a ti a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Babulon khua hi a ropui teh e! Lal chên nân ka thiltihtheihzia leh ka ropuizia tilang tûrin ka sak a nih hi,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Lalin chutia thu a la sawi lai mêk chuan vân aṭangin aw a lo chhuak a, “Lal Nebukadnezar, ka sawi hi ngaithla rawh; i ram chu i chân ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />nang pawh mihring zîng ata hnawh chhuah i ni ang a, ramsa zîngah i awm ang; bâwng angin hnim i pet ang a, Chungnungbera chuan mihringte ramah thu a nei a, a duh duh a pe mai ṭhîn tih i la hria ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chûng thil chu Nebukadnezara chungah a thleng nghâl ta mai a. Khua ata an hnawt chhuak a, bâwng angin hnim a pet a, vân daiin amah chu a tihuh a, a samte chu mupui thla chen chenin a ṭhang sei a, a tinte pawh sava tin ang mai a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Chûng ni a tâwp hnu chuan kei, Nebukadnezara hian vân lam ka thlîr a, ka rilru ngai ka pu leh ta a. Chungnungbera, kumkhuaa awma chu ka fak a, ka chawimawi ta chiam a, ‘Kumkhuaa lal tûr a ni e, A ram chu a awm hlen dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Khawvêla chêngte chu eng tham mah an ni lo va, Vâna thil awmte pawh a thu thuin a dah a, Leia awm tu mahin an dang thei lo; Engtiziaa ti nge i nih? ti thei an awm hek lo.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Rilru pângngai ka put leh rual chuan ka ram ropuina pawh a lo vul leh a, kei pawh ka ropuiin ka lal leh ta hle a. Thu min râwntute leh ram hotute chuan mi rawn bêl a, ka ram chu a ding nghet leh ta a, a ropui zâwk mah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Kei Nebukadnezara hian Vân Lalber chu ka fak a, ka chawimawi a, ka zah ta êm êm a ni; a thil tih apiang a dik a, a awm dânte pawh a âwm thlap a ni; chapote pawh a titlâwm ṭhîn.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lal Belsazaran a milian sâng tân ruai ropui tak a ṭheh a, an hmaah chuan zu a in a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Belsazaran zu a han tem chuan a pa Nebukadnezaran Jerusalem Tempul aṭanga a lâk rangkachak leh tangkaraw note kha lâk chhuah thu a pe a, lal leh a miliante, a nupui leh a hmeite zu in nân a ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jerusalem khuaa Pathian in, Tempul aṭanga an lâk note chu an la chhuak a, lal leh a miliante, a nupui leh a hmeite chuan zu in nân an hmang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zû chu an in a, rangkachak te, tangkarua te, dâr te, thîr te, thing te leh lung tea siam pathiante chu an fak ta chûl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutih lai tak chuan khâwnvâr dahna ep lal in bang zût mâm, a êng lai takah chuan mihring kut a lo lang a, thu a rawn ziak ta a; lal chuan kut che vêl chu a en reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lal chu a dâng sâwp sâwp a, a hlauh êm avângin a tha a zâwi a, a khûpte chu a sai hlawk hlawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Aien thiam te, Kaldai mi thiam te, arsi chhui mi te han ko vat teh u,” tiin lal chu a au ta chûl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lal chuan Babulon mi fingte hnênah chuan, “Tu pawh, he thu ziak hi chhiara, a awmzia sawi thei chu puan senduk ka sintîr ang a, rangkachak khaidiat ka awrhtîr bawk ang a, ka rama lal ber pathumnaah ka siam bawk ang,” a ti a. Lal mi fingte chu an lo kal a, thu ziak chu an chhiar thiam lo va, lal hriat atân an hrilh fiah thei hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lal Belsazara chu a mangang hle a, a dâng sâwp sâwp a, a miliante lah chuan tihngaihna an hre bawk si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalnu chuan lal leh a miliante thâwm chu a hriatin rang takin ruai ṭhehna pindanah chuan a lo tlân lût a, “Lalber chu dam reng rawh se. I rilru mangang suh sela, i hmêl pawh danglam hek suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />I ram chhûngah mi pakhat, Pathian thianghlim thlarau chênna a awm alâwm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I pa hun lai pawh khân hriatthiamna leh finna fiah tak, pathiante neih ang hi, a nei asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />I pa Nebukadnezara khân bo hrethei te, aien thiam te, Kaldai mi thiam te leh arsi chhui mi te hotu-ah a dah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mumang hrilh fiah te, thu khirh hriat theih te, thu ril sawi fiah te a thiam bîk a, mi fing tak a ni. A hming chu Daniela a ni, lalin a hmingah Beltesazara a sa a; ko la, hêng hi a rawn hrilh fiah mai ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lal hmaah Daniela chu an rawn hruai a. Lal chuan, “Juda mi, sal, ka pain Judai ram aṭanga a rawn hruai Daniela kha i ni em? Pathian thianghlim thlarau i hnênah a chêng a, finvârna te, hriatthiamna te leh finna te i ngah hle tih ka lo hria asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Mi fing te, aien thiam te he thu ziak hi chhiar a, a awmzia min hrilh tûrin an rawn hruai a; mahse, tu man an hrilh fiah thei lo. Nangin he thu ziak hi i chhiar theiha, a awmzia i sawi theih bawk chuan puan senduk ka sintîr ang che a, rangkachak khaidiat ka awrhtîr bawk ang che. He ram chhûngah lal ber pathumnaah ka siam bawk ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Daniela chuan a chhâng a, “I thil min pêk tumte chu nangman nei la, a nih loh leh mi dang pe zâwk ang che. He thu ziak hi ka chhiar tho vang a, a awmzia pawh ka hrilh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aw lalber, i pa Nebukadnezara chu Pathian Chungnungbera chuan a laltîr a, a tilianin a tiropui nasa êm êm a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a len êm avâng chuan mi tu pawh, hnam tin, chi tin leh ṭawng tin hmanghote chuan amah an hlau va, a hmaah an khûr ṭhîn; a duh a that a, a duh a zuah a, a duh a chawisâng a, a duh leh a tihniam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A lo inngaihlu ta hle a, a rilru chu a sakin chapo takin thil a ti ṭhîn a. Chuvângin, paih a ni a, a ropuina chhuhsak a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mihring zîng ata hnawh chhuah a ni a, a rilru chu ramsa rilru ang chauh a ni ta a; ram sabengtungte nên an tla za a, bâwng angin hnim a pet a; mihringte ram hi Chungnungbera thu thuin a awm a, a duh apiang a laltîr mai a ni tih a hriat fiah hma chu vân daiin a taksa chu a tlâk huh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nang, a fapa, Belsazar, chu thil chu i hre reng nâ a, i inngaitlâwm lo va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Vân Lalpa kalhin i inchawisâng a, a ina note chu i lâktîr a, nang leh i miliante, i nupuite leh i hmeite chuan zu in nân an hmang a. Rangkachak te, tangkarua te, dâr te, thîr te, thing te leh lung tea siam milim, eng mah hmu thei lo, ngaithla thei lo leh hre thei lote in chawimawi ta zâwk a. A kuta kawltu che, i khawsak dân tinrêng entu Pathian chu i zah lo vei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Hei vâng hian he kut hi he thu ziak tûrin a rawn tîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A thu ziak chu hei hi a ni: MENE, MENE, TEKEL tih leh PARSIN tih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mene tih chu i lal hun tûr chin a chhinchhiah a, a titâwp dâwn tihna a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tekel tih chu bûk i ni a, i tling lo tihna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Parsin tih chu i ram hi sem darh a ni a, Media leh Persia hnêna pêk a ni tihna a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lal thupêk angin Daniela chu puan senduk an sintîr a, rangkachak khaidiat ṭhi an awrhtîr bawk a, rama lal ber pathumnaah dah a nih tâk thu an puang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chumi zân ngei chuan Kaldai lal Belsazara chu an that a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Media mi Daria chuan ram chu a chang ta a, kum sawmruk leh pahniha upa a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Daria chuan ram pum pui rorêl tûrin ramawptu za leh sawmhnih dah darh ṭha a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chûngte hna enzuia lal tâna ṭha tûr thlîr zui tûrin Daniela leh mi dang pahnih a ruat bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ram awptute leh chûng hotute zîngah chuan Daniela chu a fel lawr lak a; chutia a fel bîk êm avâng chuan lal chuan ram pum hotua dah a rilrûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ramawptute leh hotu dangte chuan ram enkawl thu-ah, Daniela thil tihsual an châng ta rân a; mahse, hêkna tûr eng mah an hmu thei lo; Daniela chuan engkim dik tak leh rinawm takin a ti dim diam ṭhîn a, thil sual emaw, thil dik lo emaw a ti ngai si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chûng mite chuan, “A Pathian biak chungchâng thu-ah chauh lo chuan Daniela hi hêk chhiatna tûr kan hmu zo dâwn lo,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, lal hnênah an kal a, “Lal Daria, dam reng ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I ram enkawltu, hotute, ramawptute, upahote leh sawrkâr miliante chuan, ‘lal hian thupêk siam sela, chu a thupêk chu khauh taka lekkawh ni rawh se;’ kan ti tlâng a ni. ‘Ni sawmthum chhûng chu, nang, lal hnênah chauh lo chuan tu man, an pathian hnênah emaw, mi dang hnênah emaw eng mah an dîl tûr a ni lo,’ tih thu pe la, ‘a awih lo chu sakeibaknei pûkah paih tûr a ni,’ ti ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, lalber, he thupêk hi chhuah la, i hming ziak hnan la, lekkawh tûr a ni; Media leh Persia dân, tihdanglam theih loh chu a lo ni dâwn nia,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lal Daria chuan thupêkah chuan hming a ziak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lal chuan thupêkah hming a ziak ta tih Danielan a hriat veleh a hâwng a. A in chhâwngah chuan Jerusalem lam hawia tukverh inhawng a awm hlawm a. Ni tin, ṭhingṭhiin, tukverh inhawng hawi chuan a ṭawngṭai ṭhîn a, chutiang bawk chuan a Pathian hnênah lâwmthu a sawi leh ta tho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Daniela ertute chuan an enthla a, Pathian hnêna a ṭawngṭai chu an va hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Daniela hêk tûrin an za chuan lal hnênah an kal ta a. “Aw lalber, ‘ni sawmthum chhûng chu tu pawh, lal hnênah tih loh, an Pathian hnênah emaw, mi dang hnênah emaw thil an dîl chuan sakeibaknei pûkah paih tûr a ni’ tiin thu i pêkah hming i ziak lâwm ni kha?” an ti a. Lal chuan a chhâng a, “Ziak e, chu thupêk chu thupêk ding lai alâwm, Media leh Persia dân sût theih loh tûr a nih kha,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lal chu an chhâng a, “Judai rama mi, sal pakhat, Daniela chuan, aw lalber, i thupêk chu a zah lo va, a pawisa hauh lo, ni tin vawi thum a la ṭawngṭai tho mai,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chu thu chu lalin a han hriat chuan pawi a ti hle a, Daniela chu chhan dân tûr a ngaihtuah a. Ni tlâk thlengin a ngaihtuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chûng mite chu lal hnênah an lo kal leh a, “Nang, lalberin Media leh Persia dân ang thlapa thupêk, hming i ziak hnan tawh chu, sût leh theih a ni lo tih i hria e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tichuan, Daniela chu lal chuan a mantîr a, sakeibaknei dahkhâwmna pûkah chuan a thlâktîr ta a. Daniela hnênah chuan, “Rinawm taka a rawng i bâwl ṭhîn i Pathian chuan chhan che rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pûk chu lungin an chhîn a, tu man Daniela chu an lâk chhuah theih loh nân lal leh hotute chhinchhiahna nem meuhvin lung chu an châr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lal chu a haw a, chumi zân chuan chaw a nghei a, intihhlimna eng mah a ngaithla duh lo va, a muhîl thei hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Vârṭianah lal chu a tho va, hmanhmawh takin sakeibaknei pûkah chuan a va kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Daniela an thlâkna pûk chu a va thleng a, ṭah-awin Daniela chu a au va, “Daniel, Pathian nung rawngbâwltu, rinawm taka a rawng i bâwl ṭhin i Pathian chuan sakeibaknei kâ aṭangin a chhan ta che em?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Daniela chuan, “Aw lalber, dam reng ang che,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />eng mah min tih lo tûrin Pathianin vântirhkoh a rawn tîr a, sakeibaknei kâ a rawn tichihsak a ni; eng mah tihsual ka nei lo va, lal chungah thil dik lo eng mah ka ti hek lo tih lan nân a rawn tîr a ni,” tiin a lo chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lal chu a lâwm êm êm a. “Daniela chu pûk ata khai chhuah tûr,” a ti a. Daniela chu pûk ata an khai chhuak a, Pathian a rin tlat avângin hliam pakhat mah a tuar lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lal chuan Daniela hêktute chu man tûr a ti a, an nupui fanaute nên lam sakeibaknei awmna pûkah chuan an thlâk ta a. Pûk mawng an thlen hma hmain sakeibakneite chuan an lo seh a, an ruhte lamin an seh tliak vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lal Daria chuan khawvêla hnam tin, chi tin, ṭawng tin hmangte hnênah lehkha a ziak a; “Remna in hnênah awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thu ka pe e, ka ram chhûnga mi zawng zawngin Daniela Pathian hi an ṭihin an zah tûr a ni. Pathian nung a ni a, Chatuanin ro a rêl ang. A ram chu a chhe ngai lo vang a, A lalna chu a tâwp ngai lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A chhandam a, a chhan chhuak ta, Leiah leh vânah chhinchhiahna te, Thil mak tak takte a ti a, Sakeibaknei lakah Daniela pawh a chhan chhuak,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Daria lal lai leh Persia lal Kura lal laite chuan Daniela chu kawng engkimah a hmuingîl hle a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babulon lal, Belsazara lal kum khat kum khân mang ka nei a, zâna ka mangah hmuh ka nei a, ka ziak chhuak a, hei hi chumi zâna ka thil hmuh ziakna chu a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kil tin aṭangin thli a lo tleh a, tuifinriat chu a chhêm vak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuifinriat aṭang chuan sakawlh lian pui pui pali, inang lo ṭheuh hi an lo chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pakhatna chu sakeibaknei ang hi a ni a, mupui angin thla a nei a. Ka en reng lai chuan a thla chu an pawt kawlh a, lei ata an kaitho va, mihring angin ke pahnihin an dintîr a, mihring rilru ang an puttîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sakawlh pahnihna chu savawm ang hi a ni a, a ke hnung lamin a ding a, nâkruh pathum hi a seh a, aw lo chhuak chuan, “Ei rawh, i duhtâwkin sa ei rawh,” a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka en reng lai chuan sakawlh dang a lo lang leh a, keite ṭial ang hi a ni nâ a, a hnungzângah chuan sava thla ang hi thla pali a awm a, lu pali a nei bawk a, thuneihna an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka en reng lai chuan sakawlh palina pawh chu a lo lang a, hlauhawm tak leh râpthlâk tak, awmkhauh tak a ni. Thîr ha lian pui pui a nei ṭeuh mai a, a seh tawh chu a seh sawm a, a chîl nek ṭhîn. Sakawlh dang ang lovin ki sâwm a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A kite chu ka en reng lai chuan ki tê tak tê pakhat, ki dang zîngah chuan a lo chawr chhuak a, ki pathum lo awm sa chu a tâwn phawng a. Chu ki chuan mihring angin mit a nei a, a uangthuang thei zat zat hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka en reng lai chuan: Lalṭhutthlêng an lo hûng a, Tah chuan Hmakhawsânga chu a ṭhu a; A silhfên chu vûr anga vâr a ni a, A sam pawh sahmul vâr ang a ni. A lalṭhutthlêng chu meialh a ni a, A ke tawlailîr pawh mei kâng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuta ta chu mei a lo alh chhuak a, A rawngbâwl tûr mi sâng tam an awm a, A vêlah a sînga sîng têl an ding a, Rorêl chu an ṭan a, Lehkhabute chu an keu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka en reng lai chuan ki tê tak tê kha inchhuang taka a uang ta pâng pâng thâwm chu ka hre zui a. Ka hmuh lai chuan sakawlh palina chu an that a, a ruang chu meiah chuan an vawm lût a, a kâng ral ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sakawlh dangte thuneihna pawh an lâksak a; amaherawhchu, hun eng emaw chên an nun zêl an phalsak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zâna ka thil hmuhah chuan hei hi ka hmu bawk: Vân chhûma inthuam hringfa ang tak A lo kal a, Hmakhawsânga lam a pan a, A hnênah chuan an hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A hnênah chuan lalna te, Ropuina te, ramte an pe a. Tichuan, hnam tin, chi tin, ṭawng tin hmangte chuan Chibai an bûk a, kumkhuain thu a nei ang a, A lalna chu a tâwp ngai lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kei, Daniela hi zâna ka thil hmuh chuan min tithlaphâng a, ka buai rilru hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chûng thil te chu engtihna nge tih min hrilh fiah tûrin chuta ding zînga pakhat chu ka pan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Hêng sakawlh palite hi leia lalram lo awm tûr palite an ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />mahse, Chungnungbera mi thianghlimte chuan ram chu an nei ang a, kumkhuain an nei dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sakawlh palina chungchâng hriat chian lehzual ka duh a, sakawlh dang a ang ve lo, thîr hâ leh dâr tin nei kha a hlauhawm êm êm a. A mante chu a seh sawm a, a chîl nek a, a tiboral ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A lu-a ki sâwm awm chungchâng te, ki dang pakhat lo chawr, ki dang aia hlauhawm tak, mit nei, kâ pawh nei, chapo taka uang thâwng thâwng ṭhîn ki dang pathum rawn tâwn phawngtu chungchângte chu ka hre châk hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka en reng lai chuan ki chuan mi thianghlimte chu a bei a, a hneh ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hmakhawsânga chu a lo kal a, Chungnungbera mi thianghlimte chu thiam a rawn chantîr a, mi thianghlimte lal hun chu a lo thleng ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Sakawlh palina chungchâng hetiang hian min hrilh: “Leiah lalram palina a lo awm ang, A dangte aia danglam a ni, Lei pum pui a hneh ang a, A tichhia ang a, a chîl nek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ki sâwmte kha chu ram lal tûrte an ni, Lal dang a lo lal ang a, A hmasate ai chuan dang tak a ni ang, Lal pathum chu a hneh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chungnungbera kalhin thu a sawi ang a, Chungnungbera mi thianghlimte chu a ching chau vang a, An dânte leh kût nite tihdanglamsak a tum ang a, Kum thum leh a chanve chu a thuhnuaiah an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mahse, rorêlna chu ṭan a ni ang a, A lalna chu lâksak a ni ang a, Tihchhiat hlauh a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ram te, lalna te, vân hnuaia a ram ropui takte chu, Chungnungbera mi thianghlimte an pe ang a, Kumkhuain an lal ang a, Leia rorêltu zawng zawngin an rawngbâwlin an thu an awih ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chu chanchin chu heti zawng hi a ni.” Kei Daniela hian ka hlau êm a, ka dâng ta sâwp sâwp a, rilruin ka pai ru ta reng a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Belsazara lal kum thum kum chuan kei Daniela hian inlârna, a ṭum hnihna chu ka hmu leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Inlârnaah chuan Elam biala awm Susan khawpui chhûngah ka lo awm a. Ulai lui kamah ka lo ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka han en chuan ki sei tak pahnih nei berâmchal ka hmu a, pakhat chu a sei zâwk a, a ṭo hnuhnûng zâwk a ni bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chu berâm chuan khawthlang lam te, hmâr lam te, chhim lamte a phîn ruai a, sa pakhat mah lo cho ngam an awm lo va, a laka invêng him thei rêng an awm hek lo. A duh ang angin a che a, a inhrosa ta vak vak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Engtihna nge ni ang tih ka ngaihtuah lai chuan khawthlang lam aṭangin kêlchal, lei pawh rap hman lo khawpa chakin a lo tlân a, a mit inkârah ki pakhat sei zet hi a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lui kama berâm ding ka hmuh kha a rawn pan a, a theihtâwpa chakin a rawn phîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Berâm chu a rawn hnaih a, a si ta vak a, a ki pahnih chu a sîk tliahsak a, eng mah a ti thei ta lo va. Berâm chu leiah a si thlu a, a chîl ta nek a. Berâm chu a lak aṭanga chhan chhuak thei tu mah an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kêlchal chu a thâwm a na ta hle a; mahse, a ropui vânglai tak chuan a ki chu a tliak ta a; a aiah ki pali, kâwlkil li kâwk far, sei tak a lo ṭo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />ki pali zînga pakhat aṭang chuan ki tê tak tê hi a lo chawr chhuak a, chhim leh khawchhak lamah a ṭhang uak uak a, ram ropui lamah chuan a ṭhang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vâna mipuite tluk a tum a, chûng zînga mi leh arsi ṭhenkhat chu leiah a paih a, a chîl nek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vân mipuite hotupa tlukin a intiropui a, hâlral thilhlan, eng lai pawha an hlan ṭhin chu a tihtâwpsak a, Hmun Thianghlim pawh chu a tichhe bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An bawhchhiatna avângin mite chuan thilhlan an hlan reng ṭhin chu an bânsan a, thutak chu leiah an paih thal dêr a, ki chuan a duh duhin thil a ti ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vântirhkoh pakhat ṭawng ka hria a, vântirhkoh dangin a hnênah, “Inlârnaa thil hmuh hi eng chen daih tûr nge, thilhlan an hlan ziah ṭhin chu eng chen nge bawhchhiatna râpthlâk tak chuan a lan ang? Eng chen nge Hmun Thianghlim leh ram ropui ber chu duh duha an sawisak ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pakhat zâwk chuan a chhâng a, “Zîng leh tlai tina thilhlan an hlan ṭhin chu ṭum sânghnih leh zathum an hlân lo vang. Chumi hnuah Hmun Thianghlim chuan ngai a awh leh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kei, Daniela hian chûng ka thil hmuh awmzia chu hriat ka duh a. Mihring ni âwm tak ka hmaah a lo ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ulai lui kam lehlam aṭang chuan mi pakhat aw ka hria a, “Gabriel, a thil hmuh kha hrilh fiahsak rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka dinna bulah a lo kal a, ka hlau êm a, ka tlu bawkkhup ta a. “Mihring fapa, i thil hmuh kha khawvêl tâwp hun tûr entîrna a ni tih hre rawh,” mi ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thu a sawi lai chuan eng mah hre lovin leiah ka tlu bawkkhup a; mahse, mi rawn chelh a, mi dintîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Thinurna a lo thlen hun tûr ka hrilh dâwn che a ni, i thil hmuh hi khawvêl tâwp hun tûr thil a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ki pahnih nei berâmchal i hmuh kha Media leh Persia lal entîrna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kêlchal hmul thum kha Grik lal entîrna a ni, a mit inkâra ki sei tak kha an lal hmasa ber entîrna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ki tliak ta aiawh tûra ki pali lo chawr khân Grik ram hmun li-a inṭhen tûr a entîr a; amaherawhchu, lal hmasa ber ang khân an chak lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Chûng ram lalte an tlâwm dâwn hunah, An sual vâwrtâwp thlen dâwnin Râl rêl thiam tak a lo kal ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thil a tithei hle dâwn a, Engkim a tichhe rem rum ang. A tih apiangah a hlawhtling ang a, Hnam tam tak a tichhia ang a, Hmun Thianghlim chungah pawh a che ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A fin a kherek êm êm a, vervêk taka a thiltihte a hlawhtling zêl a, A inngairopui hle ang a, Inring hman lote a bei ang a, a tichhia ang, Hotute hotu meuh pawh a cho vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Zîng leh tlai tin thilhlan an hlan ṭhin chungchâng inlârna i hmuh kha a lo thleng ngei ang a; amaherawhchu, i thil hmuh hi i zêp tlat tûr a ni, rei tak hnua lo thleng chauh tûr a ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kei, Daniela hi ka chau dêr a, ni eng emaw zât chu ka dam lo va. Ka thawh peih hnu chuan lal hna chu ka thawk zui leh ta zêl a; mahse, ka thil hmuh avâng chuan ka bo map a, a ngaihna rêng ka hre lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Media mi Daria, Ahasuera fapa chu, Babulon ram lal a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A lal kum khatnaah chuan, kei Daniela hian, lehkhabu chu ngun takin ka chhiar a; kum sawmsarih chhûng Jerusalem khua a ram tûr thu Lalpa zâwlnei Jeremian a hrilh lâwk chungchâng kha ka ngaihtuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chaw ngheia saiip puan sin chungin vaivutah ka ṭhu a, Lalpa Pathian hnênah ṭhahnemngai takin ka ṭawngṭai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa , ka Pathian hnênah chuan ka ṭawngṭai a; ka mite thil sual tih avângin thupha ka chawi a. “ Lalpa Pathian, i ropui a, kan chawimawi a che. I thuthlungah i rinawm a, nangmah ngainaa i thupêk zâwmtute chu i lainat reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kan sual a, kan ṭha lo va, thil dik lo kan ti a, i thupêk leh i dânte kan hawisan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kan lal te, kan hotu te, kan pa te leh hnam pum hnêna i chhiahhlawh i zâwlneiten i hminga thu an sawi chu kan ngaithla duh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa , nang chuan dik takin thil i ti ṭhîn a, keini zawngin mahni kan intimualpho ta a nih hi; Judai rama la awm te, Jerusalema awm te, an sual vânga ram tin ram tanga i tihdarh Israel-te nên angkhat vek kan ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kan lalte, kan hotute leh kan pate chu zahpuiawm takin an khawsa a; Lalpa i chungah thil sual an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa ka Pathian, nang chuan ngil i nei a, i lakah hel ṭhîn mah ila min ngaidam ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kan Pathian, Lalpa aw chu kan hre duh lo va, a chhiahhlawh, a zâwlneite hmanga kan tân Dân a siam chu kan zâwm duh hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />I aw hre duh lovin Israel mi zawng zawngin i Dân an bawhchhia a, an pênsan ta che. Kan sual avângin i chhiahhlawh Mosia Dân bu-a ziak ânchhiate, hming chhâl meuhva thil ṭha lo thlentîr i tiamte kha kan chungah i rawn thlentîr ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Keini leh kan rorêltute chungah, ‘thil ṭha lo ka ti ang,’ i tih chu i rawn ti ta a, Jerusalem phei chu a tluka nâa i sawisak vân hnuaiah a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mosia Dân bu-a ziak thil ṭha lo zawng zawng kan chungah a tla nâ a, kan sualte simin kan Pathian, Lalpa lam kan hawi duh lo va, thu dik pawisain a khawngaihna kan dîl duh hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Chuvâng alâwm, hremna i lo buatsaih diam tawh chu kan chungah a lo thlen tâk ni. Kan Pathian, Lalpa chuan engkim dik takin a ti ṭhîn a, keini erawh chuan a thu kan awih ngai lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Aw Lalpa ka Pathian, i thiltihtheihzia tihlan nân i mite chu Aigupta ram aṭangin i hruai chhuak a, tûn thlengin hming i chher a. Keinin thil sual kan ti a, kan tidik lo a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aw Lalpa dik taka thil i tih ṭhin avângin khawngaih takin Jerusalem chunga i thinurna leh i thinrimna chu la kiang tawh ta che; i khawpui, i tlâng thianghlim Jerusalem chu, kan sual leh kan pate bawhchhiatna avângin kan vêla awmte chuan kamchhe tleuh nân tak an hmang ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuvângin, aw kan Pathian, i chhiahhlawh ṭawngṭaina leh dîlna hi lo ngaithla la, i hming ropui nân i hmun thianghlim chim chhe tawh chungah hian i duhsakna hmêl han tilang teh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aw Pathian, i beng lo chhi la, ngaithla teh; kan chauh tâkzia leh i hming chawi khawpui chhiat hnehzia hi en teh mah; kan dik vânga chutia ngên che kan ni lo, ngil i neih êm avânga ngên che kan ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw Lalpa, ngaithla teh, Aw Lalpa, min ngaidam rawh; Aw Lalpa, ngaihven la, lo che vat teh. I hming ropui nân, aw ka Pathian, i hming chawi khawpui leh i mite avângin muangchâng lul suh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka sual leh ka mi Israel-te sual thupha chawiin ka ṭawngṭai zêl a, ka Pathian, Lalpa hnênah a tlâng thianghlim din thar leh tûrin ka ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutia ka ṭawngṭai lai mêk chuan inlârna hmasaa ka hmuh tawh, Gabriela kha, tlai lam thilhlan hun vêlah chak zetin a lo thlâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A lo thlen chuan, “Daniel, i thinlung mit tivâr tûra lo kal ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pathian hnêna i ṭawngṭai tirh aṭang khân, ani chuan a hmangaih êm êm che a, a chhâng nghâl che a ni; a chhânna chu ka rawn hrilh dâwn che a ni. Chuvângin, a chhânna hi ngaithla ngun la, i thil hmuh chu ka han hrilh fiah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Sual leh bawhchhiatna ata i mite leh in khawpui thianghlim chhan chhuah nân hapta sawmsarih ruat a ni; sual ngaihdam a ni ang a, kumkhuain dik taka thil tih a ni tawh ang. Inlârna leh hrilhlâwkna chu a lo thleng kim tawh ang a, Hmun Thianghlim chu then fai a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hei hi chhinchhiah la, hre chiang rawh: Jerusalem din leh tûra thupêk a nih aṭangin Pathian Hriakthiha a lo lan hma chu hapta sarih a ral ang a, Jerusalem chu din thar leh a ni ang a, kawtthlêrte leh kulh bang nghet takte an siam ang. Chu chu hapta sawmruk leh pahnih a ding ang; mahse, an buai hle ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan Pathian Hriakthiha chu eng khaw lawilovah an that ang. Tin, lal thunei tak sipaite lo lian chuan Jerusalem leh Hmun Thianghlim chu an rawn tichhia ang. Tâwpna chu tui lian ang a ni ang, Pathianin a buatsaih indona leh chhiatna chu a lo thleng dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chu lal chuan mite nên hapta khat chhûng tân thu a thlung ang a, hapta chanve a ral hnu chuan inthawina leh thilhlan an hlan ṭhin chu a titâwp ang. Tenawm râpthlâk chu Tempul hmun sâng berah a dah ang; a dahtu chu Pathianin a chhiatna tûr a ruatsak ang a, a chhiat hma chu tah chuan a awm ang.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Persia rama Kura lal a nih kum thumnaah chuan Daniela, Beltesazara an tih bawk hnênah thu a lo thleng a. Thu chu a rinawm a; mahse, hriat fuh har tak a ni; amaherawhchu, inlârnaah hrilh fiahsak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutih lai chuan kei Daniela hi, lusûn angin chawlhkâr thum chhûng ka awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chaw tuihnai leh sa pawh ka ei lo va, uain pawh ka in hek lo. Kâr thum chhûng chu sahriak pawh ka thih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thla hmasa ber, ni sawmhnih leh pali ni chuan Tigris luipui kamah chuan ka ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka han dâk a, ka han en chuan puan zai sîna inthuam mi pakhat ka hmu a, Upaz rangkachaka siam kâwnghrên a hrêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A taksa chu berûl lung tle ang a ni a, a hmêl chu kâwlphe ang a ni. A mit chu meichher êng tak ang hi a ni, a bân te leh a ke te chu dâr nawh tlêt ang a ni, a aw chu mipui nasa tak thâwm ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kei, Daniela, keimah chauh hian a ni, chu inlârna hmu chu; ka bula awmte chuan eng mah an hmu ve lo; mahse, an hlau êm êm a, an khûr zawih zawih a, an biru bo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keimah chauhvin ka awm ta a, inlârna ropui tak chu ka han hmuh chuan ka chau ta hnêp a, ka hmêlte pawh tu ma hriat theih loh khawpin a danglam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A aw ka han hriat chuan eng mah hre lovin leiah ka tlu a, ka bawkkhup reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kutin min rawn chelh a, bawkvâk tûr angin min dah a, ka la khûr zawih zawih zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka hnênah, “Daniel, Pathian mi ngainat i ni, ka thu hrilh che hi ngun takin ngaithla rawh; ding char la, i hnêna thu sawi tûra tirh ka nih hi,” a ti a. Mi biak hnu chuan ka ding thei ta a, ka la khûr ta fo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka hnênah, “Daniel, hlau suh, thil hriatthiamna i neih theih nân inngaitlâwm taka i awm ṭan ni aṭang tawh khân i ṭawngṭaina chu Pathianin a ngaithla a. I ṭawngṭaina chhâng tûrin ka lo kal a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Persia ram hotupa chuan ni sawmhnih leh pakhat chhûng chu min dodâl a; mahse, vântirhkoh hotu Mikaela chu mi pui tûrin a lo kal a, keimah chauhva Persia ram hotupa bei ka ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nakina i mite chunga thil lo thleng tûr ka rawn hrilh dâwn che a ni, i inlârna hmuh kha hun rei tak hnua thil lo awm tûr chauh a ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutia a ṭawng hnu chuan ṭawng thei lovin lei chu ka bih ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mihring ang hi a lo kal a, ka hmui a rawn dek a, chutah ka âng a, ka ṭawng thei ta a. Ka hmaa ding hnênah chuan, “Ka pu, inlârna avângin ka chau hnêp a, ka khûr reh thei lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Engtin nge i chhiahhlawh hi a pu hmaah hian ka ṭawng theih ang? Tha rêng ka nei ta lo va, thâwk pawh ka thaw hlei thei lo,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mihring ang khân mi khawih leh a, tha thar min pe ta a, “Nang, Pathian ngainat mihring, hlau suh, thlamuang takin awm rawh, insangmar la, intihuai rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutia min biak hnu chuan ka lo chak leh ta a, “Mi tichak ta si a, ka pu, thu chu sawi ta che,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“I chunga thil ka tih kha i hrethiam em? Tûnah hian Persia ram hotupa bei tûrin ka kal rih dâwn a ni. Ka tihtlâwm hunah Grik ram lal a lo thawk ang. Thutak Lehkhabua ziak chu ka la hrilh fiahsak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hêng mite ka beihnaa ka lama ṭang chu in hotupa, Mikaela chauh kha a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Media mi Daria a lal kum khat kum khân kei hi ka inrawlh ve a, ka tichak ta a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tûnah thu dik ka hrilh dâwn che hi. Persia ramah mi pathum indawtin an lo lal ang a, a palina chu a hausa fâl bîk ang; a hausak avânga a chak viau tâk hnu chuan Grik ram chu a cho vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chu ramah chuan lal huai tak a lo lal ang a, ram zau tak a nei ang, a duh duhin a che vêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A lal vânglai tak chuan a ram chu a darh ang a, hmun li-a ṭhen a ni ang. Ama thlah ni lo, lal dang, a aiah an lal ang a; mahse, ani tluka chak tu mah an awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Chhim lam ram, Aigupta lal chu a chak hle ang a; mahse, lal pakhat dang kha a chak zâwk ang, a ram pawh a zau zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kum eng emaw zât hnu chuan Aigupta lal chuan hmâr lam ram, Suria lal chu ṭhianah a siam ang a, nupuiah a fanu a neihtîr ang. Mahse, an inṭhian rei lo vang, a fanu chu a pasal nên, a fa leh a chhiahhlawh chhawmte nên an that vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chûng hnu chuan chu nu unau pakhat chu a lo kal ang a, Suria lal sipaite chu a bei ang. An kulhah a luhkhung ang a, a titlâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An milim pathiante leh rangkachak leh tangkaruaa siam bungbêl, an pathian tâna an siamte chu a ram Aigupta ramah chuan a hâwnpui ang. Rei fe chhûng chu Suria ram chu a bei leh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Suria lal chuan Aigupta ram chu rûn a tum ang a; mahse, an lo hnawt kîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Suria lal fapa chuan Aigupta chu rûn tûrin sipai a la ṭeuh vang a; tui lian ang maiin an lian ang a, an kulh pakhat chu an hualsak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aigupta lal thin chu a rim ang a, Suria ram lal chu a bei lêt ang a, a sipaite chu a mansak ṭeuh vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A chak zâwk avâng leh sipai tam tak a thahsak avângin a inchhuang ta hle a; mahse, a chak zâwk reng dâwn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Suria lal chuan a hma aia tam sipai a la leh ṭeuh vang a, hun remchângah sipai tam tak leh râlthuam tam deuh nên a thawk leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aigupta ram lal lakah mi tam tak an hel ang, inlârna an hmuh tihhlawhtlin tumin i mite zînga mi kawlhsen ṭhenkhat pawh an hel ang a; mahse, an tlâwm mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Suria lal chu a lo lian ang a, an kulh chu a rawn hual ang a, a man ang; Aigupta sipaite chu an chechâng ngam lo vang, an zînga huai berte pawh chu an dawl vek dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Suria ram aṭanga rawn rûntu chuan a duh duhin a sawisa ang, khak ngam rêng an awm lo vang. Ram ropui berah pawh chuan a ding ang a, a thuhnuaiah a awmtîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Suria lal chuan a sipai rualte nên ram dang rûn a tum rilru leh a. A hmêlmapa ram a tihchhiatsak theih nân ṭhiana siam a tum ang a, nupui atân a fanu pêk a tum ang a; mahse, a hlawhtling lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan tuifinriat kama awmte chu a bei ang a, tam tak chu a hneh ang; mahse, lal pakhatin a lo hneh ang a, chapo hle mah se a titlâwm ang a, a chapona chu a chungah a lêt dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama ramah, a kulhah ngei hâwn leh a tum ang a; mahse, an that ang; chu chu a tâwpna tûr chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Chu lal aiah chuan mi pakhat a lo lal ang a, chu mi chuan a ram a lo hausak theih nân chhiah chawi luihtîr tûrin hotute a tîr chhuak ang a. Rei lo têah chu lal chu indonaah ni lovin arte thihin a thi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“A aiah mi sual deuh pakhat a lo lal dâwn, dân anga lallukhum khumtîr pawh a ni lo vang; fin vervêk thawhin a lo lal thut mai dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amah kalhtu tawh phawt chu, thuthlung hotupa meuh pawh ni se a hrût nek ang a, a lên bo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Inṭhianna thu thlunpuiin hnam dangte chu a bum ang a, ram zîm têa lal ni mah se a chak tial tial ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ram bung hausa lai laite chu an inrin loh laiin a rûn thut thut ang a, a pi leh pute tih duh ngai loh chu a ti ṭhîn ang. A râllâk te, a rawk sum te chu amah zuitute a sem bawk ṭhîn ang. Kulh nei khaw dangte pawh beih a tum zêl ang a; mahse, a hun a ral thuai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Aigupta ram lal bei tûrin a insiam chak a, huai takin sipai tam tak a hruai a; mahse, ani chuan sipai tam zet chak tak nên a lo bei lêt ang; amaherawhchu, an phiarrûkna avângin Aigupta lal chuan a ngam lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama mi, a chawhlui kîlpui ṭhinte ngei chu amah tichhetu an ni ang; a sipai tam tak chu an thi bawk ang a, an darh zo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lal pahnihte chuan chawhlui an kîl dûn ang a; mahse, intihchhiat tum rilru pu rânin dâwt an inhrilh tawn ang. A tu a mah an hlawhtling lo vang, hun ruat chu a lo la thleng si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Suria lal chu a râllâk sum zawng zawng nên a hâwng ang a, thuthlung thianghlim chu ṭhiatsak a tum ang a. A duh ang chuan a ti ang a, an ramah a kîr leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Chumi hnu deuhvah Aigupta ram a rûn leh ang a; mahse, tûn hma ang kha a ni tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amah bei tûrin Kitim-ho lawng rual a lo kal ang a, a hlau hle ang. A kîr lam chuan thinur takin thuthlung thianghlim chu ṭhiat vek a tum ang a, chu thuthlung bawhchhetute thurâwn chu a pawm dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A sipaite chuan kulh leh hnam thianghlim chu an tibawrhbâng ang, hâlral thilhlan an hlan reng ṭhin chu an tihtâwpsak ang a, tenawm râpthlâk chu an dah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Thuthlung thianghlim bânsantute chu fak derin lamṭangah a siam ang a; mahse, Pathian thu zâwmtute chu an ṭang tlat ang a, an bei lêt ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />An zînga hruaitu fingte chuan mi dang pawh an hrilh fing ang a, hun eng emaw ti chhûng chu a ṭhen salah an man ang a, an rawk bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Anmahni ṭanpui tûra inpete chuan ti tak tak ṭhîn lo mah se, chûng mi thahte chuan ṭanpuina a tâwk a fang chu an dawng tho vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />An hruaitu fing ṭhenkhat chu an thahsak ang a, chumi avâng chuan mite chu then faia tihthianghlim an ni ang. Pathian hun ruat, tâwpna hun chu a lo thlen hun chuan chutiang chuan thil a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Chu lal chu a duh duhin a che ang a, pathiante aia ropuiah a inngai ang a, pathiante Pathian meuh ai pawhin a indah sâng ang. Pathian thinurna, a tâna ruat chu a thlen hma chuan chutiang chuan a che ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chu lal chuan a pi leh pute pathian chu a ngaihthah ang a, hmeichhiaten an ngainat êm êm pathiante pawh a ngaihsak lo vang a, pathian dangte pawh pawisak rêng a nei lo vang, ropui zâwkah a inngai dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Kulh humtu pathiante erawh chu a tlawn ang. A pi leh puten an biak ngai loh pathian hnênah rangkachak te, tangka te, lungmantam te leh thil hlu tak te a hlân ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A kulh vêng tûrin ram dang pathian be mite a ruai ang a; amah lala pawmtute chu a chawimawi ang, hna ṭha tak tak a pe ang a, lâwmmanah ramte pawh a pe ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“A hun tâwp dâwn hnaiah chuan Aigupta lal chuan a rawn bei ang a; mahse, Suria lal chuan tawlailîr te, sakawr chungchuang mi te leh lawng tam tak te nên theihtâwp chhuahin ṭhâwngaleivîr angin a lo bei lêt dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ram ropui ber pawh a rawn bei tel dâwn a, mi a sînga sîng tam a that bawk ang. Edom te, Moab te leh Amon ram la bâng te erawh chu a zuah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Hêng ramte hi a rawn rûn chuan Aigupta pawh a zuah lo vang. Tuilian angin ram tam takah a lian zêl ang a, a hrût zêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Rangkachak te, tangkarua te leh an ro hlu, Aiguptahovin an dah ṭhatte chu a la ang. Libua leh Sudan pawh a thuhnuaiah a dah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Khawchhak leh hmâr lam aṭanga thu thang lo thleng chuan a tithlaphâng ang a, chu thil chu beia titâwp ṭhak tûrin a thawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tuifinriat leh tlâng thianghlim mawi ber inkârah a lal bûk a khuar ang a; mahse, a thi dâwn, tu man an ṭanpui lo vang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Chumi hunah chuan i mite enkawltu, hotu lian Mikaela chu, a lo thawk ang. Hnam lo din tirh aṭanga tûn thlengin chutiang hrehawm chu a awm tawh ngai lo vang; i mite erawh chu chhan chhuah an ni ang, lehkhabua an hming chuang apiangte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lei vaivuta mu tawhte pawh an lo tho vang, ṭhenkhat chu chatuan nun chang tûrin an lo tho leh ang a, ṭhenkhat erawh chu an zak êm êm ang a, kumkhaw hmuhsit an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hruaitu fingte chu vâna êng angin an êng ang a, thil dik ti tûra mi dang hruaitute pawh chu arsi angin an êng kumkhua ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Amaherawhchu, Daniel, tâwpna a lo thlen hma chu, thu chu thup la, lehkhabu chu châr tlat rawh, hriat duhin mi tam tak an phi ruai dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kei, Daniela hian ka han en a, lui kam tuakah mi pahnih ding ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lui hnâr zâwka ding, puan zai sîna inthuam hnênah chuan, “Hêng thil mak tak tak hi engtikah nge a tâwp ang?” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lui hnâr zâwka ding, puan zai sîna inthuam chuan, a kut khing hnih a phar a, chatuan Pathian hming chhâl meuhvin a sawi a: “Hun khat, hun hnih, hun chanve chhûng tûr a ni. Pathian mite tihduhdah a tâwp hun chuan hêng thilte hi a thleng kim vek ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A sawi chu ka hre nâ a, a ngaihna erawh chu ka hre lo, “Ka pu, hêng zawhah hian engtin nge ni ang?” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Daniel, kal mai rawh, tâwpna a lo thlen hma chu thu hi thupa châr hnan tlat a ni tawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi tam tak an inthian fai ang a, an insu vâr ang a, tihthianghlim an ni ang; mi sualte erawh chuan an hrethiam lo vang a, an sual lui zêl ang, mi fingte chauhvin an hrethiam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Ni tin thil hlan ṭhin an tihtâwp a, tenawm râpthlâk an dah ni aṭangin ni sângkhat leh zahnih leh sawmkua a ral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ni sângkhat leh zathum leh sawmthum leh panga chhûng rinawm taka awm chhuak chu a nihlawh e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Daniel, nang chu kal ta la, i hun tâwp a thlen hma chu rinawm takin awm rawh. I hahchâwl ang a, tâwpna a lo thlen hunah i awmna tûr hmun ruatah chuan i awm dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
</usx>
